{"id":139869015617052,"name":"Hard Wall Hop Difficulty Chart Stage Obby","desc":"⭐ Welcome to Hard Wall Hop Difficulty Chart Stage Obby!\n\nMaster the Art of Wallhop! This unique obby challenges your skills using the classic Roblox wallhop glitch. Progress through stages with increasing difficulty! 💪 Don't know how to wallhop? Search 'How to Wallhop in Roblox' on YouTube – tons of guides available! The game gets harder and harder as it progresses!\n\n✨ Join the group to unlock Free Skip! https://www.roblox.com/communities/32931518\n\n😃 There are currently 10 unique difficulty levels, featuring a total of 95 challenging stages! 🔥\n💀 Stuck too long? Press R to reset instantly and try again faster!\n\n😁 If you enjoy the game, don’t forget to Like & Favorite it really helps!  \nThanks for playing! 👍\n\nTags: Obby, Parkour, Platformer, Obstacle Course, Tower, Easy, Hard, Impossible, Difficulty Chart, DCO, Lava, IMPOSSIBLE, Unbeatable, Extreme, Wall Hop, Wallhop","path":"/game/139869015617052-hard-wall-hop-difficulty-chart-stage-obby","slug":"139869015617052-hard-wall-hop-difficulty-chart-stage-obby","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/92e59b24cb95c7a0d26f7b62d74b4fd08c6d9f3837341879353f36d33fc9c2fa.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-aa0d62032f74045b80b376ec3d961e05/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":26040531,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-10-19T04:12:03.864Z","creator":{"name":"Nevyrous","type":"User"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"totalPages":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"68f46513346d83703099b9f3","title":"Auto Finish","game":{"_id":"6835c5e134b8aa444285fda4","gameId":139869015617052,"name":"Hard Wall Hop Difficulty Chart Stage Obby","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/ef6fb2b911d400325bd3171c4e5ed20e5f17d5f4f1d21f8a0dc5809eb6fe7b3e.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-7c68901325de584148cc38ce2f69503a-e2c913472114.png"},"slug":"139869015617052-hard